{"seq":1,"slug":"higher-order-functions","title":"高阶函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/functional-patterns/higher-order-functions","wordCount":650,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"高阶函数\">高阶函数</h1><p>高阶函数是 Kotlin 函数式编程的基石——它接受函数作为参数或返回函数作为结果。配合 lambda 表达式、内联优化和 SAM 转换，Kotlin 提供了简洁而高效的函数式编程体验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>高阶函数的核心是<strong>函数作为一等公民</strong>：函数拥有自己的类型（如 <code>(Int) -&gt; Int</code>），可以作为参数传入、作为结果返回，也可以被 lambda 或函数引用赋值。这一能力让复用单位从「值」扩展到「行为」。围绕它，<code>inline</code> 在编译期消除 lambda 的对象分配，SAM 转换让 Kotlin 函数类型与 Java 接口互操作，<code>noinline</code>/<code>crossinline</code> 则精确控制内联边界。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"函数类型\">函数类型</h2><p>Kotlin 中，函数是一等公民，拥有明确的类型表示：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val sum: (Int, Int) -&gt; Int = { a, b -&gt; a + b }&#10;val greet: (String) -&gt; String = { name -&gt; &quot;你好, $name&quot; }&#10;val action: () -&gt; Unit = { println(&quot;执行动作&quot;) }&#10;val nullable: ((Int) -&gt; String)? = null\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val sum: (Int, Int) -> Int = { a, b -> a + b }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val greet: (String) -> String = { name -> \"你好, $name\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val action: () -> Unit = { println(\"执行动作\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val nullable: ((Int) -> String)? = null</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数类型语法</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>(A, B) -&gt; C</code></td>\n<td>接受 A、B 参数，返回 C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>() -&gt; Unit</code></td>\n<td>无参数无返回值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>(Int) -&gt; String</code></td>\n<td>接受 Int 返回 String</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>A.(B) -&gt; C</code></td>\n<td>A 的扩展函数类型，接受 B 返回 C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>suspend () -&gt; T</code></td>\n<td>挂起函数类型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"lambda-表达式\">Lambda 表达式</h2><p>Lambda 是定义匿名函数的简洁语法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val numbers = listOf(3, 1, 4, 1, 5, 9)&#10;&#10;val sorted = numbers.sortedBy { it }&#10;val filtered = numbers.filter { it &gt; 3 }&#10;val mapped = numbers.map { &quot;数字: $it&quot; }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val numbers = listOf(3, 1, 4, 1, 5, 9)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val sorted = numbers.sortedBy { it }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val filtered = numbers.filter { it > 3 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val mapped = numbers.map { \"数字: $it\" }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Lambda 的语法规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 完整形式&#10;val sum1: (Int, Int) -&gt; Int = { a: Int, b: Int -&gt; a + b }&#10;&#10;// 类型推断&#10;val sum2 = { a: Int, b: Int -&gt; a + b }&#10;&#10;// 单参数使用 it&#10;val double = { it: Int -&gt; it * 2 }&#10;&#10;// 尾随 lambda&#10;numbers.filter { it &gt; 3 }.map { it * 2 }&#10;&#10;// 解构声明&#10;mapOf(&quot;A&quot; to 1, &quot;B&quot; to 2).forEach { (key, value) -&gt;&#10;    println(&quot;$key = $value&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 完整形式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val sum1: (Int, Int) -> Int = { a: Int, b: Int -> a + b }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 类型推断</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val sum2 = { a: Int, b: Int -> a + b }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 单参数使用 it</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val double = { it: Int -> it * 2 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 尾随 lambda</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>numbers.filter { it > 3 }.map { it * 2 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 解构声明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mapOf(\"A\" to 1, \"B\" to 2).forEach { (key, value) -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(\"$key = $value\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"高阶函数定义\">高阶函数定义</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun &lt;T&gt; List&lt;T&gt;.customFilter(predicate: (T) -&gt; Boolean): List&lt;T&gt; {&#10;    val result = mutableListOf&lt;T&gt;()&#10;    for (item in this) {&#10;        if (predicate(item)) result.add(item)&#10;    }&#10;    return result&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun &lt;T, R&gt; List&lt;T&gt;.customMap(transform: (T) -&gt; R): List&lt;R&gt; {&#10;    val result = mutableListOf&lt;R&gt;()&#10;    for (item in this) {&#10;        result.add(transform(item))&#10;    }&#10;    return result&#10;}&#10;&#10;val evens = listOf(1, 2, 3, 4, 5).customFilter { it % 2 == 0 }&#10;val names = listOf(&quot;alice&quot;, &quot;bob&quot;).customMap { it.uppercase() }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun &#x3C;T> List&#x3C;T>.customFilter(predicate: (T) -> Boolean): List&#x3C;T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val result = mutableListOf&#x3C;T>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (item in this) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (predicate(item)) result.add(item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun &#x3C;T, R> List&#x3C;T>.customMap(transform: (T) -> R): List&#x3C;R> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val result = mutableListOf&#x3C;R>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (item in this) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        result.add(transform(item))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val evens = listOf(1, 2, 3, 4, 5).customFilter { it % 2 == 0 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val names = listOf(\"alice\", \"bob\").customMap { it.uppercase() }</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;高阶函数 f(g)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;接收函数 g 作为参数&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;在内部调用 g()&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;返回函数作为结果&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"高阶函数 f(g)\"] --&gt; B[\"接收函数 g 作为参数\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"在内部调用 g()\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"返回函数作为结果\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"inline-函数\">inline 函数</h2><p>高阶函数每次调用 lambda 都会创建一个匿名类对象，<code>inline</code> 关键字消除这个开销：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"inline fun &lt;T&gt; measureTime(block: () -&gt; T): Pair&lt;T, Long&gt; {&#10;    val start = System.nanoTime()&#10;    val result = block()&#10;    val duration = System.nanoTime() - start&#10;    return result to duration&#10;}&#10;&#10;val (value, time) = measureTime {&#10;    (1..1_000_000).sum()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>inline fun &#x3C;T> measureTime(block: () -> T): Pair&#x3C;T, Long> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val start = System.nanoTime()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val result = block()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val duration = System.nanoTime() - start</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return result to duration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val (value, time) = measureTime {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (1..1_000_000).sum()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>编译器将 <code>inline</code> 函数的函数体和 lambda 直接内联到调用处，避免了函数对象分配和虚拟调用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>是否使用 inline</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>接收 lambda 参数的小函数</td>\n<td>✅ 推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大型函数体</td>\n<td>❌ 代码膨胀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无 lambda 参数</td>\n<td>❌ 无意义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要 reified 类型参数</td>\n<td>✅ 必须</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"noinline-与-crossinline\">noinline 与 crossinline</h2><p>当 inline 函数有多个 lambda 参数时，可以选择性地禁止内联：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"inline fun execute(&#10;    inlined: () -&gt; Unit,&#10;    noinline stored: () -&gt; Unit // 不内联，可以被存储&#10;) {&#10;    inlined()&#10;    callbacks.add(stored) // noinline lambda 可以赋值给变量&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>inline fun execute(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    inlined: () -> Unit,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    noinline stored: () -> Unit // 不内联，可以被存储</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    inlined()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    callbacks.add(stored) // noinline lambda 可以赋值给变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>crossinline</code> 禁止 lambda 中使用非局部返回：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"inline fun runInThread(crossinline block: () -&gt; Unit) {&#10;    Thread {&#10;        block() // crossinline：block 不能使用 return 跳出 runInThread&#10;    }.start()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>inline fun runInThread(crossinline block: () -> Unit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Thread {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        block() // crossinline：block 不能使用 return 跳出 runInThread</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }.start()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[inline 函数的 lambda 参数] --&gt; B{需要存储 lambda?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[noinline]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{在非局部上下文执行?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[crossinline]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[默认 inline]\">flowchart TD\n    A[inline 函数的 lambda 参数] --&gt; B{需要存储 lambda?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[noinline]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{在非局部上下文执行?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[crossinline]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[默认 inline]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"sam-转换\">SAM 转换</h2><p>Kotlin 支持对 Java 的单抽象方法（SAM）接口进行自动转换：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// Java 接口&#10;// public interface OnClickListener {&#10;//     void onClick(View view);&#10;// }&#10;&#10;button.setOnClickListener { view -&gt;&#10;    println(&quot;点击了按钮&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Java 接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// public interface OnClickListener {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//     void onClick(View view);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>button.setOnClickListener { view -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(\"点击了按钮\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Kotlin 1.4+ 也支持对 Kotlin 的 <code>fun interface</code> 进行 SAM 转换：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun interface Transformer&lt;T, R&gt; {&#10;    fun transform(input: T): R&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun &lt;T, R&gt; applyTransform(value: T, transformer: Transformer&lt;T, R&gt;): R {&#10;    return transformer.transform(value)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 使用 SAM 转换&#10;val result = applyTransform(&quot;hello&quot;) { it.uppercase() }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun interface Transformer&#x3C;T, R> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun transform(input: T): R</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun &#x3C;T, R> applyTransform(value: T, transformer: Transformer&#x3C;T, R>): R {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return transformer.transform(value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用 SAM 转换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val result = applyTransform(\"hello\") { it.uppercase() }</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Kotlin 的 <code>fun interface</code> 必须用 <code>fun</code> 关键字修饰才能支持 SAM 转换，普通 interface 不行。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"函数引用\">函数引用</h2><p>可以使用 <code>::</code> 操作符将已有函数转为函数类型的值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun isEven(n: Int): Boolean = n % 2 == 0&#10;&#10;val numbers = listOf(1, 2, 3, 4, 5)&#10;val evens = numbers.filter(::isEven)&#10;&#10;// 成员函数引用&#10;val lengths = listOf(&quot;hello&quot;, &quot;world&quot;).map(String::length)&#10;&#10;// 构造函数引用&#10;data class User(val name: String)&#10;val users = listOf(&quot;Alice&quot;, &quot;Bob&quot;).map(::User)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun isEven(n: Int): Boolean = n % 2 == 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val numbers = listOf(1, 2, 3, 4, 5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val evens = numbers.filter(::isEven)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 成员函数引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val lengths = listOf(\"hello\", \"world\").map(String::length)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 构造函数引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class User(val name: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val users = listOf(\"Alice\", \"Bob\").map(::User)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>函数类型</strong>是 Kotlin 的一等类型，支持参数化、可空、扩展函数类型和挂起函数类型</li>\n<li><strong>Lambda 表达式</strong>是定义匿名函数的简洁语法，支持 <code>it</code>、尾随 lambda、解构等语法糖</li>\n<li><strong>高阶函数</strong>接受函数参数或返回函数，是函数式编程的核心</li>\n<li><strong>inline</strong> 消除 lambda 的对象分配开销，<code>noinline</code> 允许存储 lambda，<code>crossinline</code> 禁止非局部返回</li>\n<li><strong>SAM 转换</strong>支持将 lambda 自动转换为 <code>fun interface</code>（Kotlin）或 SAM 接口（Java）</li>\n<li><strong>函数引用</strong>（<code>::func</code>）将已有函数转为函数类型值</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高阶函数","id":"高阶函数"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"函数类型","id":"函数类型"},{"level":2,"text":"Lambda 表达式","id":"lambda-表达式"},{"level":2,"text":"高阶函数定义","id":"高阶函数定义"},{"level":2,"text":"inline 函数","id":"inline-函数"},{"level":2,"text":"noinline 与 crossinline","id":"noinline-与-crossinline"},{"level":2,"text":"SAM 转换","id":"sam-转换"},{"level":2,"text":"函数引用","id":"函数引用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"异常处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/coroutines/exception-handling"},"next":{"title":"作用域函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/functional-patterns/scope-functions"}}